    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Twelve Signs of the Zodiac",
      "",
      "In Western culture, the whole world is composed of four elements: wind, fire, earth, and water.",
      "The twelve signs of the zodiac can also be divided into four groups according to these four elements.",
      "",
      "The first group is associated with the fire element, and has Aries, Leo, and Sagittarius.",
      "People in these zodiac signs are often very optimistic and cheerful and filled with passion towards the world.",
      "",
      "The second group is associated with the earth element, and has Taurus, Virgo, and Capricorn.",
      "These people are often of a relatively steady and serious nature, and not too good at expressing their own feelings.",
      "",
      "The third group is associated with the wind element, and includes Gemini, Libra, and Aquarius.",
      "The characters of the people in these zodiac signs are fairly innocent and romantic, and full of curiosity about the world.",
      "",
      "The fourth group is associated with the water element, with Cancer, Pisces, and Scorpio.",
      "The characters of the people in these three signs are usually quite sensitive, and they believe in their own intuition.",
      "",
      "What is your zodiac sign? What is your character like then?",
